"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/settings/settings.html>`_),"
" o el/la user's own localization setting desde dentro de el/la `Usuario "
"Settings section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/user_settings/user_settings.html>`_."
" More específico/específica localization settings (such como un/una "
"user's setting over el/la appliance-wide setting) override less "
"específico/específica settings."

